---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const markets=[['Forex','EURUSD · GBPUSD · USDJPY'],['Gold','XAUUSD'],['Indices','NAS100 · US30 · SPX500'],['Crypto','BTCUSD · ETHUSD'],['Commodities','Oil · Silver']];
---
<BaseLayout title="Market — Trade Avata"><section class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">Market</span><h1 class="page-title">Watch the markets without the noise.</h1><p class="lead">A lightweight market area for watchlists and context. Live provider data can plug into this interface later without redesigning the page.</p></div></section><section class="section" id="market-watch"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Watchlist</span><h2>Major markets</h2></div><p>Demo values below show the intended frontend structure before a live market-data provider is connected.</p></div><div class="grid grid-3">{markets.map(([name,symbols],i)=><button class="card card-link" type="button" data-market={name} style="text-align:left;color:inherit"><span class="chip">{name}</span><h3 style="margin-top:12px">{symbols}</h3><p>{i%2?'+0.42% demo change':'-0.18% demo change'} · Tap to select</p></button>)}</div><div class="notice" data-market-status style="margin-top:16px">Select a market group to preview the interaction.</div></div></section><script is:inline>document.querySelectorAll('[data-market]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>document.querySelector('[data-market-status]').textContent=b.dataset.market+' selected. Live prices will connect through the chosen market-data provider.'));</script></BaseLayout>
